 ## My Player
-Your own character in the same world, on an AI-run club. Hub (`scripts/ui/player_hub.gd`) pages:
+Your own character in the same world, on an AI-run club. You live it day by day: you start (and come back
+after every match) in your home; the PC opens the career hub; the door takes you out into the city.
+- **Days** (`scripts/career/life_sim.gd`, `LifeSim`): a week is 7 days of 4 slots (morning, afternoon, evening,
+  night). Activities use slots; sleeping starts the next day; sleeping through Sunday night runs the week
+  (`World.advance_week`). Your match is Saturday evening (PC "play online", or drive to the arena); miss it and the
+  team plays without you (benched, coach trust down). "Skip to match time" / "Skip to next week" sleep through.
+- **Needs**: energy, food, fun, social. They drift every slot and set your mood (morale) each morning.
+- **Drinking, smoking, drugs**: beer/wine/cocktails/shots (drunk level, blackout at the top, hangover the next
+  day), cigarettes, weed, and two fictional banned drugs: Vex (stimulant: sharper, then a crash) and Blitz (party
+  pill: great night, brutal comedown). Use builds dependence: cravings, withdrawal, a rehab week from your phone.
+  Banned drugs stay in your system for days: match-day drug tests (more likely in cups) mean bans, fines, lost sponsors.
+- **Match effects** (`LifeSim.match_mods`): rating change for sims plus, when you play, crosshair sway, extra
+  spread, slower movement and camera wobble (drunk, hungover, high, crashing, tired, hungry; "fresh" gives a bonus).
+- **Trouble**: paparazzi after nights out, the coach noticing hangovers and a pattern of nights out, bar fights,
+  drink driving (police pull you over: fine, licence suspended, car towed), crashes (repairs, injuries).
+- **The city** (`scenes/city.tscn`, `scripts/city/city.gd`): a top-down district with traffic, police, pedestrians,
+  a minimap with GPS (M), day/night lighting. Drive your best car (F in/out) or walk; taxi from the phone.
+  Places: home, corner shop, gym, training ground, diner, park, The Neon Tap (bar), Prestige Motors (shop page),
+  Pulse (club, nights only), Lockdown Arena.
+- **Venues** (`scripts/career/venues.gd`, rooms from `art/venues/venues.py` -> `data/venues/*.json`, shown by the
+  home scene): drink at the bar, dance, VIP booth, the dealer in the club's back corridor, workouts, sauna, team
+  practice, demo review, food and coffee, the corner shop's stash items. Patrons: fans (photos), locals, pros
+  from other clubs (chat, buy a drink, talk shit, fight) and sometimes your teammates. Opening hours by slot.
+Hub (`scripts/ui/player_hub.gd`) pages:
 Overview, Inbox, Messages, Feed, Home, Shop, Profile, Training, Career, Team, League, Tournaments, Stats, History, plus the news ticker.
 - **Shop** (`scripts/career/lifestyle.gd`, `scripts/ui/shop_view.gd`): property, cars, home extras, pets, style,
   weapon finishes (tint your guns in matches), personal staff and investments. Each item has an effect and weekly upkeep.
